                <category>Industry News</category>
                <description><![CDATA[Bayer CropScience Limited reported a 19% revenue decline in Q2 FY 2026-27, while profit before tax rose 6%. H1 revenue fell 11%, but profit increased 15%. The company announced an interim dividend of ₹90 per share amid challenging agricultural market conditions.]]></description>
